High Plains Research Station and Arboretum- 25LSO-0366, 1.1
historic site.
FISCAL NOTE
Up to $3,338,756 from AMOUNTS PREVIOUSLY APPROPRIATED to the Department of Parks
and Cultural Resources by 2024 Wyoming Session Laws, Ch. 118, Sec. 2, Sec. 24,
footnote 7 may be expended for the High Plains Research Station and Arboretum
state historic site. This expenditure authorization is effective immediately.
